# ディスク修復 (design 11.25), for tools/ui_run.py with the disk that
# tools/tests/dfix_disk.py makes: its first partition (vblka0) a volume
# damaged on purpose -- a count raised, three blocks taken that nothing
# uses, a block of a record marked free, two documents that link only to
# each other. The accessory runs as a process (application/diskfix); its
# window (a panel of its data box, 600x476, its corner at 339,171; a part
# at l,t of the panel at 339+l,171+t) lists vblka0 and the system volume
# vblka2 in a list, a row 18 pixels apart from 214. A question stands in
# the middle of the screen, 取消 at 735,448 and 実行 at 838,448; 障害情報
# opens down and right of it, 前へ at 400,661, 次へ at 498,661, 保存 at
# 836,661, 終了 at 940,661.
#
# A check is an administrator's: each 開始 asks the desktop, which asks for
# the administrator's password in a panel over its own window (the keys
# are that panel's). The disk's administrator has none at first, so the
# first time it is chosen, typed twice (Tab to the second box); after it
# the password is typed once. The rights are given back when the check is
# over.
#
# The menus of the second button open with the item chosen last on the
# pointer's row, the rows 20 pixels apart (a line is a row too). That of
# ディスク修復: 閉じる, line, 開始, 障害情報, line, 検査, 修復, line,
# 簡易, 通常, 完全, line, ドライブの一覧を更新, ウインドウ, 小物, 実行.
# That of 障害情報: 閉じる, line, 前へ, 次へ, line, 保存, ウインドウ,
# 小物, 実行.
#
# First vblka0 looked at (検査, 通常), started from the menu: seven
# things found, shown in 障害情報, saved as ディスク修復記録 with 保存 of
# its menu and closed with its 閉じる. Then repaired (修復, asked first):
# the seven put right, two pages of 障害情報. Then looked at whole (検査
# and 完全 chosen in the menu): nothing. The system volume: 修復 asks to
# start the machine again, and is left (取消); 検査 finds nothing while
# it runs. The program run again while its window is up brings that
# window forward. Last the window is carried by its band, made larger by
# its corner, and closed with Ctrl+E, the letter of 閉じる.
open 01a0d8c4-53e0-7a31-8c42-5d6e7f8053e0
expect dfix: opened 2
wait 600
shot df_open
# 検査, 通常, vblka0: 開始 of the menu (閉じる under the pointer, 開始 two rows below)
click 640 300 1
expect dfix: menu 1
wait 300
shot df_menu
click 648 340
expect dfix: chosen dfix.start
wait 1000
shot df_admin_choose
text ktest-admin
key 2b
text ktest-admin
wait 300
key 28
expect the administrator's password was set
expect dfix: administrator 0
expect dfix: done 1: found 7 fixed 0 left 7 refused 0 unfixable 0 er 0
wait 400
shot df_checked
# 障害情報, saved and closed from its menu
click 410 624
expect dfix: info 1 page 1
wait 400
shot df_info
click 640 420 1
expect dfix: menu 2
wait 300
shot df_info_menu
click 648 520
expect dfix: chosen dfix.save
expect disk: the record of ディスク修復 written (0)
expect dfix: saved 1 0
wait 300
# 保存 under the pointer now, 閉じる five rows above it
click 640 420 1
expect dfix: menu 3
wait 300
click 648 320
expect dfix: info closed 1
# 修復: asked first, then the password
click 750 240
wait 200
click 875 372
expect dfix: ask 1 実行
wait 400
shot df_ask
click 838 448
expect dfix: answered 1 1
wait 1000
text ktest-admin
key 28
expect dfix: administrator 0
expect dfix: done 2: found 7 fixed 7 left 0 refused 0 unfixable 0 er 0
wait 400
shot df_repaired
click 410 624
expect dfix: info 2 page 1
wait 400
shot df_info_repair
click 498 661
expect dfix: info 3 page 2
wait 400
shot df_info_repair2
click 940 661
expect dfix: info closed 2
# 検査 and 完全 from the menu (開始 under the pointer, then 検査): nothing left
click 640 300 1
expect dfix: menu 4
wait 300
click 648 360
expect dfix: chosen dfix.check
click 640 300 1
expect dfix: menu 5
wait 300
click 648 400
expect dfix: chosen dfix.full
wait 200
shot df_full_chosen
click 875 372
wait 1000
text ktest-admin
key 28
expect dfix: done 3: found 0 fixed 0 left 0 refused 0 unfixable 0 er 0
wait 400
shot df_after
# the system volume: 修復 asks to start again, and is left
click 420 232
click 750 240
click 750 306
wait 200
click 875 372
expect dfix: ask 2 実行
wait 300
click 838 448
expect dfix: answered 2 1
expect dfix: ask 3 実行
wait 400
shot df_sys_ask
click 735 448
expect dfix: answered 3 0
# the system volume looked at while it runs
click 750 214
wait 200
click 875 372
wait 1000
text ktest-admin
key 28
expect dfix: done 4: found 0 fixed 0 left 0 refused 0 unfixable 0 er 0
wait 400
shot df_system
# run again while its window is up: that window to the front, no second one
open 01a0d8c4-53e0-7a31-8c42-5d6e7f8053e0
wait 800
shot df_again
# carried by its band, made larger by its corner, closed with Ctrl+E
win ディスク修復
drag 500 158 540 138
wait 300
win ディスク修復
drag 980 632 1047 690
wait 300
win ディスク修復
shot df_moved
key 08 01
expect dfix: closed
absent !OACV!
